e schema. The object {{"properties": {{"foo": ["bar", "baz"]}}}} is not well-formatted.\n\nHere is the output schema:\n```\n{{"description": "Pydantic model for the entire state structure.", "properties": {{"messages": {{"title": "Messages", "description": "List of message dictionaries", "type": "array", "items": {{"$ref": "#/definitions/BaseMessage"}}}}, "hypothesis": {{"title": "Hypothesis", "description": "Current research hypothesis", "default": "", "type": "string"}}, "process": {{"title": "Process", "description": "Current research process", "default": "", "type": "string"}}, "process_decision": {{"title": "Process Decision", "description": "Decision about the next process step", "default": "", "type": "string"}}, "visualization_state": {{"title": "Visualization State", "description": "Current state of data visualization", "default": "", "type": "string"}}, "searcher_state": {{"title": "Searcher State", "description": "Current state of the search process", "default": "", "type": "string"}}, "code_state": {{"title": "Code State", "description": "Current state of code development", "default": "", "type": "string"}}, "report_section": {{"title": "Report Section", "description": "Content of the report sections", "default": "", "type": "string"}}, "quality_review": {{"title": "Quality Review", "description": "Feedback from quality review", "default": "", "type": "string"}}, "needs_revision": {{"title": "Needs Revision", "description": "Flag indicating if revision is needed", "default": false, "type": "boolean"}}, "sender": {{"title": "Sender", "description": "Identifier of the last message sender", "default": "", "type": "string"}}}}, "definitions": {{"BaseMessage": {{"title": "BaseMessage", "description": "Base abstract message class.\\n\\nMessages are the inputs and outputs of ChatModels.", "type": "object", "properties": {{"content": {{"title": "Content", "anyOf": [{{"type": "string"}}, {{"type": "array", "items": {{"anyOf": [{{"type": "string"}}, {{"type": "obj